{
  "api": "openai",
  "from_version": "v1",
  "to_version": "v2",
  "summary": "v1 is a total rewrite requiring explicit client instantiation with client = OpenAI() instead of global openai.* functions, with all resource methods namespaced under client.* and config/errors renamed (api_base->base_url, proxy->proxies, InvalidRequestError->BadRequestError, api_resources->resources). Response objects are now pydantic models instead of dicts and must use attribute access with model_dump()/model_dump_json(), and list() pagination now auto-iterates instead of auto_paging_iter(). Many globals and helpers were removed including api_key_path/app_info/debug/log/OpenAIError, Audio.transcribe_raw/translate_raw, ErrorObject/Customer/Deployment/Engine, File.find_matching_files, embeddings_utils, requestssession/aiosession and all a* methods (use OpenAI client, async client, httpx, cookbook, or azure-mgmt-cognitiveservices).",
